        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-DLW7012SMTSBR, Decorative 12 Inch Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Spanish 12 Inch Appliance Pull comes packaged with everything you need to install it on a standard appliance panel. This beautiful pull can be used on both the refrigerator and the freezer. It is available in a ton of gorgeous finishes, including some of the most popular in today's design trends.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW07-specifcations.gif?v=1704354703\" width=\"419\" height=\"286\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions AP-DLW7012SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Spanish Design Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12.03\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 9.26\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2.37\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>These Refrigerator pulls are supplied with countersunk screws for mounting to 3/4\" - 1\" thick panels (standard appliance panel thickness).</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262222\"><b>First Impressions AP-DLW7012SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
