                "description": "The Spanish 12 Inch Appliance Pull comes packaged with everything you need to install it on a standard appliance panel. This beautiful pull can be used on both the refrigerator and the freezer. It is available in a ton of gorgeous finishes, including some of the most popular in today's design trends.\r\n",
